---
// Componente Footer - Diseño táctico y limpio
---
<footer
	class="bg-[#0c1324] py-12 px-8 border-t border-[#191f31] font-['Inter'] text-sm"
>
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
		<div class="space-y-4">
			<div
				class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-[#00FF41] text-2xl"
			>
				Rolaps
			</div>
			<p class="text-[#b9ccb2] max-w-xs">
				Sistemas tácticos de seguridad y desarrollo. Elevando el
				estándar digital para negocios ambiciosos.
			</p>
			<div class="flex gap-4">
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#00FF41]"
					>verified_user</span
				>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#00FF41]"
					>lock</span
				>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#00FF41]"
					>bolt</span
				>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
			<div class="space-y-2">
				<p
					class="font-bold text-[#dce1fb] uppercase text-xs tracking-widest mb-4"
				>
					Contacto
				</p>
				<a
					class="block text-[#b9ccb2] hover:text-[#00FF41] transition-colors"
					href="#">WhatsApp</a
				>
				<a
					class="block text-[#b9ccb2] hover:text-[#00FF41] transition-colors"
					href="#">Email</a
				>
				<a
					class="block text-[#b9ccb2] hover:text-[#00FF41] transition-colors"
					href="#">Formulario</a
				>
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-2">
				<p
					class="font-bold text-[#dce1fb] uppercase text-xs tracking-widest mb-4"
				>
					Legal
				</p>
				<a
					class="block text-[#b9ccb2] hover:text-[#00FF41] transition-colors"
					href="#">Privacidad</a
				>
				<a
					class="block text-[#b9ccb2] hover:text-[#00FF41] transition-colors"
					href="#">Términos</a
				>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="space-y-6">
			<p
				class="font-bold text-[#dce1fb] uppercase text-xs tracking-widest"
			>
				Newsletter Táctica
			</p>
			<div class="flex">
				<input
					class="bg-surface-container border-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary-container rounded-l-lg w-full text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/50"
					placeholder="email@ejemplo.com"
					type="email"
				/>
				<button
					class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container px-4 rounded-r-lg font-bold"
					>Unirse</button
				>
			</div>
			<p class="text-[10px] text-[#b9ccb2]/50">
				© 2024 Rolaps Tactical Systems. All rights reserved.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
